{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13566","headline":"耶溪书怀寄刘长卿员外 · 秦系","name":"耶溪书怀寄刘长卿员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"时人多笑乐幽栖，晚起闲行独杖藜。\n云色卷舒前後岭，药苗新旧两三畦。\n偶逢野果将呼子，屡折荆钗亦爲妻。\n拟共钓竿长往复，岩陵滩上胜耶溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秦系","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13566.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13566","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}